{title: King of Glory}
{key: Eb}

{comment: Intro}
[Cm]      [Eb]      [Ab]      [Fm]

{comment: Verse 1}
Yes, the [Cm]world will [Fm7]bow down and [Eb]say You are [Bb]God
Every [Cm]man will [Fm7]bow down and [Eb]say You are [Bb]King
So let's s[Ab]tart [Bb/Ab]right   [Ab]now
Why [Bb]would [Cm/Bb]we       [Bb]wait?

